#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Next steps {#next-steps}"
msgstr "الخطوات التالية {#next-steps}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"tip\" title=\"Recommendations\">\n"
"- Learn about the [primitive base classes](/guides/primitives) that the IBM Quantum primitives are based on.\n"
"- Review detailed [Estimator](/guides/estimator-examples), [Sampler](/guides/sampler-examples), or [Executor](/guides/executor-examples) examples.\n"
"- See the input and output details for [Estimator](/guides/estimator-input-output), [Executor](/guides/executor-input-output), and [Sampler](/guides/sampler-input-output).\n"
"- Practice with primitives by working through the [Cost function lesson](/learning/courses/variational-algorithm-design/cost-functions) in IBM Quantum Learning.\n"
"- See the [EstimatorV2 API reference](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/estimator-v2), [SamplerV2 API reference](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/sampler-v2), and [Executor API reference](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/executor).\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"tip\" title=\"توصيات\">\n"
"- تعرَّف على [primitive base classes](/guides/primitives) التي تستند إليها IBM Quantum primitives.\n"
"- راجع أمثلة تفصيلية لـ [Estimator](/guides/estimator-examples) و[Sampler](/guides/sampler-examples) و[Executor](/guides/executor-examples).\n"
"- اطَّلع على تفاصيل الإدخال والإخراج لـ [Estimator](/guides/estimator-input-output) و[Executor](/guides/executor-input-output) و[Sampler](/guides/sampler-input-output).\n"
"- تدرَّب على الـ Primitives من خلال [درس دالة التكلفة](/learning/courses/variational-algorithm-design/cost-functions) في IBM Quantum Learning.\n"
"- راجع [مرجع API لـ EstimatorV2](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/estimator-v2) و[مرجع API لـ SamplerV2](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/sampler-v2) و[مرجع API لـ Executor](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/executor).\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
